WEBVTT

00:10:57.954 --> 00:11:01.329
But research has shown that you're more
likely to get a job through weak ties.

00:11:01.579 --> 00:11:03.204
Your more distant acquaintances,

00:11:03.954 --> 00:11:06.246
they travel in different circles
and have access to

00:11:06.246 --> 00:11:08.329
a broader pool of connections and ideas,

00:11:08.662 --> 00:11:11.704
which puts them in a better position
to open up new opportunities.

00:11:12.537 --> 00:11:15.371
Sadly, the people who need
those ties the most are

00:11:15.371 --> 00:11:16.996
the least likely to reach out to them.

00:11:17.746 --> 00:11:19.996
Research reveals that when their
jobs are under threat,

00:11:20.329 --> 00:11:23.537
people with lower social class tend
to narrow their networks.

00:11:23.912 --> 00:11:26.787
While people with higher status tend
to broaden their networks,

00:11:27.371 --> 00:11:28.912
they reach beyond the inner circle,

00:11:29.662 --> 00:11:33.287
which actually turns out to be a way of
changing course when the going is rough